                                "en": "He wanted to <w>sharpen</w> the saw before use.",
                                "it": "Voleva <w>affilare</w> la sega prima dell'uso."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "De molenaar laat de stenen <w>tanden</w>.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Мельник велит <w>насечь</w> жернова.",
                                "en": "The miller has the stones <w>dressed</w>.",
                                "it": "Il mugnaio fa <w>ravvivare</w> le macine."
